"id":"9052:3977","nm":"Body","x":16,"y":161,"w":343,"h":600,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","st":1,"k":"t","r":[{"s":"Before we even dive in, we know what you\u2019re thinking. It\u2019s way easier (like WAY easier) to grab lunch out with coworkers, right? Packing lunch is such a drag. Not only do you have to do all the things to get ready for work, but now you have to food prep? Yeah, we know, making your own lunch is a hard sell. \n\nBut, what if we told you it didn\u2019t have to require a ton of your spare super-duper valuable time? We have solutions. We\u2019re letting you in on some top-secret hacks that only the boss ladies know about when it comes to packing lunches for work with little to no time. Oh, and they\u2019re weight loss-friendly. Pretty dope, huh?\n\nSo, let\u2019s get to it. Grab your note pad, and jot down notes on what\u2019s going to make your life easier when it comes to packing your lunch. Because guess what? Packing your lunch may be a gamechanger, helping you reach your health goals, no matter what they are. ","f":"AktivGrotesk","wt":400,"z":16,"lh":24,"c":"#545656"}],"ah":"LEFT","av":"TOP","ar":"HEIGHT"},{"id":"9052:3697","nm":"Image","x":16,"y":777,"w":343,"h":217,"sh":"FILL","sv":"FIXED","st":1,"k":"f","bg":[{"img":"a1gbtv4j1pjuzap"}],"sc":"#e8eaea","sw":[0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5],"sa":"INSIDE","rad":14},{"id":"9052:3691","nm":"Body","x":16,"y":1010,"w":343,"h":660,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","st":1,"k":"t","r":[{"s":"Why Eating Lunch Out Every Day is Not Such a Great Idea \n","f":"AktivGrotesk","wt":700,"z":16,"lh":24,"c":"#1e2020"},{"s":"Real talk-we need to talk about why eating lunch out can be a real buzz kill for your weight loss success. While that caesar salad and taco bowl may appear healthy (those salad dressing are quite deceiving), your daily lunch outing may be holding back your health success more than you know. \n\nHere are just a few reasons why you may want to say no to that afternoon lunch date with your coworker BFF and ask them to join you in your brown bag lunch challenge instead. \n\n","f":"AktivGrotesk","wt":400,"z":16,"lh":24,"c":"#545656"},{"s":"Hello Sodium\u2026.and water retention\n","f":"AktivGrotesk","wt":700,"z":16,"lh":24,"c":"#1e2020"},{"s":"Let\u2019s just take a moment to talk about the fact that sandwiches really aren\u2019t all that healthy. Sandwiches are often a go-to lunch choice as they are easy, affordable, and can be woofed down at your desk. So, what\u2019s the problem? Cold cuts are loaded with sodium, and too much sodium equals water retention.","f":"AktivGrotesk","wt":400,"z":16,"lh":24,"c":"#545656"}],"ah":"LEFT","av":"TOP","ar":"HEIGHT"}]}]},{"id":"9052:3990","nm":"Related","x":0,"y":2045.5,"w":375,"h":453,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","st":1,"k":"f","clip":1,"lm":"V","g":16,"p":[8,16,48,16],"pa":"MIN","ca":"MIN","ch":[{"id":"9052:3714","nm":"Title","x":16,"y":8,"w":343,"h":32,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","st":1,"k":"t","r":[{"s":"Related","f":"Poppins","wt":700,"z":24,"lh":32,"c":"#1e2020"}],"ah":"LEFT","av":"TOP","ar":"HEIGHT"},{"id":"9052:3991","nm":"Divider","x":16,"y":56,"w":343,"h":1,"sh":"FILL","sv":"FIXED","st":1,"cn":"Divider","cs":"Divider","k":"f","bg":[{"c":"#e8eaea"}]},{"id":"9052:3992","nm":"Article","x":16,"y":73,"w":343,"h":100,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","st":1,"k":"f","clip":1,"lm":"H","g":8,"p":[0,0,0,0],"pa":"MIN","ca":"CENTER","ch":[{"id":"9052:3993","nm":"Text","x":0,"y":19,"w":235,"h":62,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","gr":1,"k":"f","clip":1,"lm":"V","g":6,"p":[0,0,0,0],"pa":"MIN","ca":"MIN","ch":[{"id":"9052:3713","nm":"Category","x":0,"y":0,"w":235,"h":16,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","st":1,"k":"t","r":[{"s":"HIIT","f":"Poppins","wt":700,"z":12,"lh":16,"c":"#c13262"}],"ah":"LEFT","av":"TOP","ar":"HEIGHT"},{"id":"9052:3712","nm":"Title","x":0,"y":22,"w":235,"h":40,"sh":"FILL","sv":"HUG","st":1,"k":"t","r":[{"s":"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit","f":"Poppins","wt":600,"z":16,"lh":20,"c":"#1e2020"}],"ah":"LEFT","av":"TOP","ar":"HEIGHT"}]},{"id":"9052:3994","